From 31e1deacb2a341c9addf8b1bd1ef6934606a3498 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shachindra <shachindra.spidey@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Mar 2026 22:36:29 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: switch to UpCloud infra, add SNS + SOL balance to
 wallet popup & profile

- Terraform: replace Vultr provider with UpCloudLtd/upcloud ~> 5.0
  - Update main.tf: upcloud_server, upcloud_firewall_rules, login block
  - Update variables.tf: upcloud_username, upcloud_password, zone, plan
- API/app: replace all VULTR_API_KEY refs with UPCLOUD_USERNAME/PASSWORD
  - Update .env.example, launch/route.ts, agents/route.ts, [id]/route.ts
  - Update deploy page to use UPCLOUD_ZONES with correct zone IDs
- lib/supabase.ts: VULTR_REGIONS -> UPCLOUD_ZONES with UpCloud zone IDs
- lib/terraform/provisioner.ts: update TerraformVars + tfvars template
- lib/solana.ts: add getSNSDomain() via Helius DAS searchAssets (no extra pkg)
- components/UserMenu.tsx: show SNS badge + address, live SOL balance w/ loading state
- components/Navbar.tsx: fetch SNS + balance in parallel on auth, persist to localStorage
- app/profile/page.tsx: hydrate SNS from cache, fetch fresh if missing, show SNS badge
- app/manifesto/page.tsx: 100K USD reward announcement + email register modal
